From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Caden-Calderon <caden.calderon03@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 18:16:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] kinect-studio: modern toolchain fixes + JPEG tee color
 processor

- CMake >=3.16 minimums (CMake 4.x compat); GLVND OpenGL linking
- Pin CL_TARGET_OPENCL_VERSION=120 for current Khronos headers;
  guard CL_ICDL_VERSION macro clash in both OpenCL depth processors
- Export LIBFREENECT2_WITH_TURBOJPEG_SUPPORT in public config.h
- New TeeJpegRgbPacketProcessor + TeeColorFrame: per color frame,
  deliver decoded BGRX AND the untouched device JPEG bytes from a
  fixed refcounted pool (drop-with-count on exhaustion, never blocks)
- Tee pipeline variants: TeeCpuPacketPipeline, TeeOpenGLPacketPipeline,
  TeeOpenCLPacketPipeline, each exposing teeStats()
